[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_4EP_C08_REPORT_FUEL_SILO]
Operation <=Greenlight=> Top Secret Files

[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_4EP_C08_REPORT_FUEL_SILO_DESC]
After obtaining those abnormal employee rules by accident, our agents immediately investigated the purpose and actions of the illegal empire, but to no avail.
But another accident... We got the top secret files of Operation <=Greenlight=>...
Although many key information in the files has been damaged, we can still roughly guess the content of the files: these files must be related to Canterlot and the Empire fire safety experts.

